\title{Maggie Miller：Fibered Links in S⁴}
\date{2026-10-14}
\taxon{Reference}
\author{author}

\p{Maggie Miller，Fibered Links in #{S^4}，Proceedings of the International Congress of Mathematicians 2026，第4卷，383–393页。[出版文本](https://doi.org/10.1137/25M1806107)采用 CC BY 4.0 许可。}
\p{报告的局部变形技术来自 Miller，[Extending fibrations of knot complements to ribbon disk complements](https://doi.org/10.2140/gt.2021.25.1479)，Geometry & Topology 25 (2021)，1479–1550，以及 Miller–Zupan，[Equivalent characterizations of handle-ribbon knots](https://doi.org/10.4310/CAG.2023.v31.n9.a1)，Communications in Analysis and Geometry 31 (2023)，2157–2193。各条目注明具体使用的命题或局部变形。}
\p{报告版权归 International Mathematical Union，2026。[CC BY 4.0](https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/) 许可下的关联笔记为中文改写，补充基础定义及计数推导，并校正增补链环的符号与带数公式。}
